// MISTAKE: two employers before the name of a 401(k). An employer is no owner of one (a taxpayer is), so each fits the
// `employer` only, which takes one word: the words do not fit the slots together. 122 is a word that fits two.
base USD
use std
use us/401k

entity fidelity : org
entity bluefin : employer
entity acme : employer

account bluefin/acme/401k at fidelity

opening 2026-01-01
  bluefin/acme/401k 5_000 USD
